  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.2.0 - Folder Operations Update\n            - NEW: Folder endpoints (list, delete, bulk move)\n            - NEW: GET /folders - List all unique folder paths\n            - NEW: DELETE /folders/{path} - Delete folder and all contents\n            - NEW: POST /bulk-move - Move multiple files to new folder\n            - ENHANCED: Better folder management capabilities\n            - Supports nested folder operations\n            - Configurable endpoint options for folder features\n            \n            Version 0.1.0 - Initial Release\n            - Pre-built minimal API endpoints for file operations\n            - IFormFile upload support via endpoints\n            - UseStashPup middleware for file serving\n            - MapStashPupEndpoints for automatic API generation\n            - Dependency injection extensions (AddStashPup)",
